        {
          "id": "regression-workflow-protect-non-prose-and-real-lists-with_skill",
          "prompt": "Copy-edit the prose in this README excerpt. Return the edited excerpt as Markdown, without wrapping the whole thing in a code fence.\n\n---\ntitle: RetryPolicy\n---\n\n# RetryPolicy\n\nIt is important to note that RetryPolicy has the ability to retry requests. The API is not thread-safe. The only supported operations are read, write, and retry.\n\n> “A vibrant tapestry,” wrote Mina.\n\nSee [RetryPolicy](https://example.invalid/api/retry?mode=robust#usage).\n\n```ts\nconst retryPolicy = { mode: \"robust\", attempts: 3 };\n```",
          "checks": [
            {"id": "frontmatter-preserved", "type": "required_content", "value": "---\ntitle: RetryPolicy\n---"},
            {"id": "technical-limitation-preserved", "type": "required_content", "value": "not thread-safe"},
            {"id": "all-three-operations-preserved", "type": "regex", "pattern": "(?i)\\bread\\b.{0,60}\\bwrite\\b.{0,60}\\bretry\\b"},
            {"id": "exhaustive-scope-preserved", "type": "regex", "pattern": "(?i)\\b(?:only|exclusively|limited to|no other operations)\\b"},
            {"id": "quotation-preserved", "type": "required_content", "value": "> “A vibrant tapestry,” wrote Mina."},
            {"id": "link-target-preserved", "type": "required_content", "value": "https://example.invalid/api/retry?mode=robust#usage"},
            {"id": "code-preserved", "type": "required_content", "value": "```ts\nconst retryPolicy = { mode: \"robust\", attempts: 3 };\n```"},
            {"id": "prose-framing-removed", "type": "regex", "pattern": "(?i)\\A(?!.*it is important to note).+\\Z"},
            {"id": "no-editorial-commentary", "type": "regex", "pattern": "(?i)\\A(?!.*(?:\\bchanges?:|\\bno (?:changes?|edits?) (?:needed|necessary)|\\b(?:I|we) (?:changed|removed|replaced|kept)\\b|\\bhere(?:['’]s| is) (?:the|your) (?:edited|revised)|\\blet me know\\b)).+\\Z"}
          ],
          "regression_from": "workflow/protect-non-prose-and-real-lists/with_skill",
          "source_run_id": "workflow/protect-non-prose-and-real-lists/with_skill",
          "trace_path": "evidence/editorial-notes.json",
